                                                "example_id": "7739717e-9e4a-450d-bb59-1cbdc10ac6bd",
                                                "sense_id": "dcf0a106-9367-3499-9606-8046b8264015",
                                                "text": "The Cauſe may be Want of Perſpiration : For Much of the Matter of Haire, in the other Parts of the Body, goeth forth by Inſenſible Perſpiration ; And beſides, the Skull being of a more ſolide Subſtance, nouriſheth and aſſimilateth leſſe, and excerneth more."
